    <briefdescription>
<para>Fixed-size owned array of <computeroutput>fq_nmod_struct</computeroutput> slots tied to an <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_g_f_flint_big" kindref="compound">ARingGFFlintBig</ref></computeroutput> for the matching FLINT context. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each slot is <computeroutput>fq_nmod_init2</computeroutput>-initialised at construction and <computeroutput>fq_nmod_clear</computeroutput>-released in the destructor, so the array owns its FLINT-side data. Used as the flat per-row buffer the dense linear-algebra templates expect. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
